@format 1
@id ui-event.e6c181fede45
@title Console relay combo — scene-row action click
@section I. UI
@area UI event
@tabs Global interface
@event-ref addhandler|PMainArea/PConsoleScene.cs|PConsoleSceneAttach|pConsoleRelayCombo|ButtonBase.ClickEvent|PConsoleDeleteHandle|1
@entry input
@summary Delete the named scene represented by a dropdown-row minus button without loading that scene.
@tag button base click
@tag PConsole
@alias owner = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PConsole

[input] Scene-row action clicked <input>
- Receive the bubbled button click registered on the console scene dropdown @ owner.PConsoleSceneAttach
> target

[target] Is this a named scene action? <decision>
- Read the scene name from the clicked row button's data context @ owner.PConsoleDeleteHandle
? "No scene name" > ignored
? "Named scene" > delete

[delete] Delete named scene <process>
- Mark the action handled, cancel deferred scene loading, and run the named-scene deletion flow @ owner.PConsoleDeleteHandle
> output

[output] Selector refreshed <output>
= The stored scene is removed, the active association is cleared when necessary, and the current window layout is preserved.
! Continues in project.delete-scene.

[ignored] Non-row button ignored <output>
= Button events without a named-scene data context continue without invoking scene deletion.
